# Grok's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-grok-setting-token = A SuperGrok bearer token, only needed when the Grok CLI is not signed in on the selected host (run `grok login` there instead when you can). It is the "key" of the https://auth.x.ai entry in ~/.grok/auth.json. xai- API keys do not work.
